{"id":"n71364-4-7","stage":3,"title":"찌르다 · 告密","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71364-4-7-1","ko":"내가 수업에 빠졌다고 선생님께 찌른 게 너지?","zh":"就是你告诉老师我缺课的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"수업에","meaning":"课","explanation":"수업：课；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업에","audio":"/audio/db0846a81dcf81aae77c.mp3"}},{"text":"빠졌다고","meaning":"缺席，不参加，退出，脱离","explanation":"빠지다：缺席，不参加，退出，脱离；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"8","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빠졌다고","audio":"/audio/88d432b499e834e5c6e2.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님께","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님께","audio":"/audio/bcdd3ceebd3e89795264.mp3"}},{"text":"찌른","meaning":"告密，告发，举报","explanation":"찌르다：告密，告发，举报；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찌르다","audio":"/audio/0fb4e786abddd81c7cf7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71364","senseId":"4","lemma":"찌르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌른","audio":"/audio/66120883d884b2f23c6f.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","au